== canonical (must match) ==
'CLAUDE.md' -> Claude Code parts= ['claude.md']
'claude.md' -> Claude Code parts= ['claude.md']
'AGENTS.md' -> AGENTS.md (Codex 등) parts= ['agents.md']
'agent.md' -> AGENTS.md (Codex 등) parts= ['agent.md']
'.cursorrules' -> Cursor parts= ['.cursorrules']
'.mcp.json' -> MCP 서버 설정 (Claude Code 등) parts= ['.mcp.json']
'.claude/x' -> Claude Code parts= ['.claude', 'x']
'/workspace/.claude/settings.json' -> Claude Code parts= ['workspace', '.claude', 'settings.json']
'.github/instructions/a.md' -> GitHub Copilot parts= ['.github', 'instructions', 'a.md']
'.github/prompts/x/y.md' -> GitHub Copilot parts= ['.github', 'prompts', 'x', 'y.md']
'.continue/cfg' -> Continue parts= ['.continue', 'cfg']
'.roo/x' -> Roo Code parts= ['.roo', 'x']

== prior fixes (must still match) ==
'ＣＬＡＵＤＥ.md' -> Claude Code parts= ['claude.md']
'CLAUDE.md::$DATA' -> Claude Code parts= ['claude.md']
'CLAUDE.md:stream' -> Claude Code parts= ['claude.md']
'CLAUDE.md.' -> Claude Code parts= ['claude.md']
'CLAUDE.md ' -> Claude Code parts= ['claude.md']
'ſclaude.md' -> None parts= ['sclaude.md']
'clauſe? n/a' -> None parts= ['clause? n', 'a']
'.claude/a\\..\\..\\x' -> Claude Code parts= ['.claude', 'a', 'x']

== residual: default-ignorables / zero-width (downstream symmetry) ==
'claude\u200b.md' -> None parts= ['claude\u200b.md']
   NFKC==claude.md ? False
'claude\u200d.md' -> None parts= ['claude\u200d.md']
   NFKC==claude.md ? False
'\ufeffclaude.md' -> None parts= ['\ufeffclaude.md']
   NFKC==claude.md ? False
'claude.md️' -> None parts= ['claude.md️']
   NFKC==claude.md ? False
'CLAUDE\xad.md' -> None parts= ['claude\xad.md']
   NFKC==claude.md ? False

== residual: 8.3 short name ==
'CLAUDE~1.MD' -> None parts= ['claude~1.md']
'AGENTS~1.MD' -> None parts= ['agents~1.md']
'CURSOR~1' -> None parts= ['cursor~1']

== residual: trailing chars browsers/windows may strip (besides . space) ==
'CLAUDE.md~' -> None parts= ['claude.md~']
'CLAUDE.md\t' -> Claude Code parts= ['claude.md']
'CLAUDE.md\n' -> Claude Code parts= ['claude.md']
'CLAUDE.md\u3000' -> Claude Code parts= ['claude.md']
'CLAUDE.md\x7f' -> None parts= ['claude.md\x7f']
'CLAUDE.md\x00' -> None parts= ['claude.md\x00']

== residual: turkish/kelvin casefold ==
'İlaude.md' -> None parts= ['i̇laude.md']
'cŁaude.md' -> None parts= ['cłaude.md']
'Kelvin' -> None parts= ['kelvin']

== .github boundary conditions ==
'.github/instructions' -> None parts= ['.github', 'instructions']
'.github/instructions/a.md' -> GitHub Copilot parts= ['.github', 'instructions', 'a.md']
'.github/prompts' -> None parts= ['.github', 'prompts']
'.github/chatmodes/x' -> GitHub Copilot parts= ['.github', 'chatmodes', 'x']
'.github/workflows/x.yml' -> None parts= ['.github', 'workflows', 'x.yml']
'.github/instructions/sub/a.md' -> GitHub Copilot parts= ['.github', 'instructions', 'sub', 'a.md']

== over-match: colon truncation & dirs ==
'foo:CLAUDE.md' -> None parts= ['foo']
'.claude:extra/x' -> Claude Code parts= ['.claude', 'x']
'notes/agent.md' -> AGENTS.md (Codex 등) parts= ['notes', 'agent.md']
'src/.roo/thing' -> Roo Code parts= ['src', '.roo', 'thing']
'a:b:c' -> None parts= ['a']

== NFD (macOS stores decomposed) for an accented sibling - not canonical ascii ==
'claude.md' True -> Claude Code
